      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds right. i want to make sure it sounds heavy enough so they realize i'm not just some random person. can you help me draft the actual text? i want to mention that the contracts were signed under a specific private trust that bypasses the standard public filings, and that i have the original wet-ink signatures to back it up. i want the letter to basically say: \"I am aware of the obfuscation regarding the [Name] Trust holdings, and I am formally demanding a meeting to present the foundational documents that prove my direct lineage and control over the Paramount IP assets.\" does that sound like a strong way to frame it?",
